%% Sequence Diagram: Youth Account Management Feature
sequenceDiagram
    participant Parent as Parent/Guardian
    participant WebApp as Banking Web Application
    participant APIGW as API Gateway
    participant API as Youth Account API
    participant Account as Account Service
    participant Transaction as Transaction Service
    participant Settings as Settings Service

    %% Dashboard View
    Parent->>WebApp: Login (OAuth)
    WebApp->>APIGW: GET /api/youth-accounts/{id}/dashboard (OAuth)
    APIGW->>API: Forward request
    API->>Account: Fetch account balance
    API->>Settings: Fetch spending limit
    API->>Transaction: Fetch recent transactions
    API-->>APIGW: Aggregate dashboard data
    APIGW-->>WebApp: Dashboard JSON
    WebApp-->>Parent: Render dashboard

    %% Fund Transfer
    Parent->>WebApp: Initiate fund transfer
    WebApp->>APIGW: POST /api/youth-accounts/{id}/fund-transfer (OAuth)
    APIGW->>API: Forward transfer request
    API->>Account: Validate & process transfer
    API->>Transaction: Log transaction
    API-->>APIGW: Transfer result
    APIGW-->>WebApp: Transfer status
    WebApp-->>Parent: Show result

    %% Set Spending Limit
    Parent->>WebApp: Set weekly limit
    WebApp->>APIGW: PUT /api/youth-accounts/{id}/spending-limit (OAuth)
    APIGW->>API: Forward limit update
    API->>Settings: Update limit
    API-->>APIGW: Limit updated
    APIGW-->>WebApp: Update confirmation
    WebApp-->>Parent: Show confirmation

    %% Transaction History
    Parent->>WebApp: View transaction history
    WebApp->>APIGW: GET /api/youth-accounts/{id}/transactions?params (OAuth)
    APIGW->>API: Forward request
    API->>Transaction: Fetch paginated history
    API-->>APIGW: Transaction history
    APIGW-->>WebApp: History JSON
    WebApp-->>Parent: Render history
